v0.1.16 shipped. Five changes in this release:

- Anthropic online capacity guard: requests now blocked against output-token =
limits before sending
- Max-parallel request processor: configurable concurrency limit in the onlin=
e processor
- Gemini batch request processor: initial Gemini support in the batch layer
- JSON output fix: curly-brace handling corrected in the JSON repair path
- Version bump and release cut

No breaking changes to the public API. Full details in Release notes: v0.1.16=
 on the engineering wiki.

